--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON REPOSITORY SIZE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These are @3x print-resolution masters totalling roughly 79 MB, which every clone
of this repository pays for in full. If the repository is published, replacing
them with web-resolution derivatives and keeping the masters in asset storage
would remove the great majority of that cost. This is a packaging concern, not a
licensing one, and is recorded here only because this is where a reader will be
looking when they wonder why the clone is large.
